        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "空手の大会で、彼は組み手の実力を遺憾なく発揮した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "組み手の練習を通じて、相手の動きを予測する力が鍛えられる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "初心者向けの組み手では、安全性とルール遵守が最優先される。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "yotsu-gumi clinch",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "力士たちが四つ組み手で力を競う場面は、相撲の見所である。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "得意な組み手に持ち込むことが、力士の勝利の鍵となる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この横綱の組み手の強さは、相撲界でも指折りだと評判だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "grip",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "警察官が容疑者と組み手になり、もみ合いになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "格闘技での組み手は、相手をコントロールするための重要な技術だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "喧嘩の最中、二人は組み手のまま地面に転倒した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "gloss": "underhand pass with clasped hands (volleyball)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "バレーボールの組み手パスは、チームの攻撃を支える重要な技術だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "女子バレー選手たちは、精密な組み手パスの習得に励んでいる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "組み手での繋ぎが上手いチームは、相手を圧倒できる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "gloss": "grappler",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "プロレスの組み手たちは、観客を興奮させるダイナミックな技を繰り出す。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その組み手の体格と技術は、世界チャンピオンの素質を備えている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "若手組み手がベテラン組み手と対戦する試合は、いつも熱戦になる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "gloss": "braider",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "組み手職人が手作りする籠は、その耐久性と美しさで知られている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "祖母は組み手職として、一日中わらを編む仕事をしていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "組み手の技術は世代から世代へと受け継がれていく伝統工芸だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
